    skos:definition "The transformed-consumer-output door: `gmeow convert --to gts` serializes a frozen carrier straight to GTS bytes. The output describes whatever the consumer handed in, so it carries no registry of its own and one declared medium governs the whole artifact."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:producerCallSite "crates/pipeline/src/transcode.rs" ;
